{"artifact_id": "MS-02", "chunk_id": "MS-02:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "7bf445a1e34b6b1c1c2cf17a0af61202b3433775e17e2950350387cfbcbbfdba", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "# MS-02 — Mark Point Taxonomy"}
{"artifact_id": "MS-02", "chunk_id": "MS-02:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "567114dbb58ecfb25e05a028fd5f17a3e8c9ffa0a1dc26e6e26d24ba93185613", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Purpose\n\nThis artifact catalogues the mark-point forms of the 4CH1 mark schemes as parsed in\nthe official exam corpus of record (SRC-QPMS-4CH1): the \"- **(N)**\" point lines, the\nM1/M2 labels, the pooled per-correct allocations and the point-level conditions that\ngovern credit. The taxonomy is read strictly off the parsed text — the family law\nforbids mark-point inventiveness beyond it — and this artifact writes nothing to any\ncanonical mark_points plane. Every claim is carried on a bounded, locator-addressed\nexcerpt from the run's evidence pack. Research artifact."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-02", "chunk_id": "MS-02:sec:SCOPE", "content_sha256": "12f906099d6ffc7f4ebad9ebb4de81cddfec6b30ca04d7a44acde29a2e410a8a", "heading": "Scope", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Scope\n\n**Covers:** single and pooled point lines; per-point annotations (IGNORE/ALLOW);\nstep-point chains on calculations; the M1/M2 encoding; point-level dependency and\nconsequentiality conditions.\n\n**Grounding:** SRC-QPMS-4CH1 (the 2019-06 2C paper of the pack).\n\n**Out of scope:** required-answer elements (MS-03), alternatives breadth (MS-04),\nmark-loss semantics (MS-05)."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-02", "chunk_id": "MS-02:sec:EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY", "content_sha256": "23f8e129d807f44d62e66010b0202aad67443e6c0dfd93930669dc4654c19865", "heading": "Executive Summary", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Executive Summary\n\nThe parsed mark schemes encode marks in two coordinated notations: bracketed point\nlines (\"- **(1)**\", \"- **(2)**\", \"- **(3)**\") that state what each mark is for, and\nM1/M2 labels inside the guidance that name the same points for humans. Points\nsplit cleanly: independent facts each get their own (1) line with per-point\nannotations (IGNORE/ALLOW); calculations get step-points with no-working penalties;\ntable/grid tasks get pooled lines (\"1 mark for each correct\"). Point-level\nconditions — dependency and consequential marking — are printed on the point lines\nthemselves, so the whole credit structure of an item is machine-readable from the\nparsed corpus."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-02", "chunk_id": "MS-02:sec:MAIN_ANALYSIS", "content_sha256": "7fb62975e791ae44ab0c85c87c0d040939264ba410482842e28232986fbe958b", "heading": "Main Analysis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Main Analysis"}
{"artifact_id": "MS-02", "chunk_id": "MS-02:sec:EVIDENCE_SOURCE_BASIS", "content_sha256": "e0c6d5ffd32194245faaf5b6e30a9aff62b3323e5e55ba46ce9c3dd322be5c77", "heading": "Evidence / Source Basis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Evidence / Source Basis\n\nPrimary evidence: SRC-QPMS-4CH1 — the 2019-06 2C official extraction (60 bounded\nline-window excerpts, locators preserved; mark-scheme text cited verbatim from the\ncorpus of record). No examiner reports consumed; no specimen material cited;\nsupplementary sources not consumed for claims."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-02", "chunk_id": "MS-02:sec:LIMITATIONS_COVERAGE_GAPS", "content_sha256": "65e562c8ba9d51d17ab93aa2b01cc1b72ba114a35077d9195bcc521a76e80026", "heading": "Limitations / Coverage Gaps", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Limitations / Coverage Gaps\n\nThe taxonomy covers the point forms visible in the pack's excerpts of one 2C paper;\nrare forms in other sessions are neither catalogued nor denied. The artifact makes\nno claim about the visual mark-scheme grids of the original PDFs beyond what the\nparse preserves. No canonical mark_points plane was read or written."}
