{"artifact_id": "MS-02", "chunk_id": "MS-02:rec:MS-007", "content_sha256": "87b658b19661542addfc1fef75cdd69d288e6b6f7dd6f0a0ba48ca3dd8516499", "heading": "MS-007", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-007", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-007", "text": "### MS-007 — The bracketed point-line inventory\n\n**Claim:** mark points print as bracketed lines \"- **(N)**\" with N = 1..3 observed,\nstating the credit each carries.\n**Evidence:** \"- **(1)** 13\" on the mass-number item (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 19-33); \"- **(2)** ALLOW black\" on the\ncolour-completion task (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 64-78);\n\"- **(3)** 1 mark for each correct\" on the opening grid task (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 19-33).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-02", "chunk_id": "MS-02:rec:MS-008", "content_sha256": "8eadbcf1f7d97895e74a6d8a269524fc3e490783afcab7d76adbd7e86b81261f", "heading": "MS-008", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-008", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-008", "text": "### MS-008 — Independent facts split into annotated points\n\n**Claim:** multi-fact answers split into one point per fact, each with its own\nannotation.\n**Evidence:** the isotopes sentence completion prints \"- **(1)** protons IGNORE\nelectrons\" and \"- **(1)** neutrons\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 43-57), with the M1/M2 labels of the same points in the guidance rows\n(SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 30-44).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-02", "chunk_id": "MS-02:rec:MS-009", "content_sha256": "bf7475541e025aaef60fbab6528ba95700fe9c9c35e00c3ae50beac68244879d", "heading": "MS-009", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-009", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-009", "text": "### MS-009 — Step-points on calculations with no-working rules\n\n**Claim:** calculation marks are step-points — each printed with its working — and\nbare answers are capped by no-working notes on the point line.\n**Evidence:** the RAM calculation's three points: \"- **(1)** (35 × 77.78) + (37 ×\n22.22)\", \"- **(1)** 3544.44 ÷ 100 OR 35.4444 OR M1 ÷ 100\" and \"- **(1)** 35.4 35.4\nwith no working scores\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 84-98).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-02", "chunk_id": "MS-02:rec:MS-010", "content_sha256": "3ecf895f5ba001741d429f270aaaa10d89bbf8b1f36d10a4e4220db679d3444d", "heading": "MS-010", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-010", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-010", "text": "### MS-010 — Pooled marks for grid and table tasks\n\n**Claim:** table/grid tasks print a single pooled point line whose credit is defined\nper correct cell rather than per named answer.\n**Evidence:** \"- **(3)** 1 mark for each correct\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 19-33) and the pooled colour-allowance line \"-\n**(2)** ALLOW black\" (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 64-78).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-02", "chunk_id": "MS-02:rec:MS-011", "content_sha256": "86349d167a5ba5d80e73772c0aa23897fec52cf6b14b7980057a913038193d12", "heading": "MS-011", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-011", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-011", "text": "### MS-011 — The M1/M2 encoding of the same points\n\n**Claim:** the guidance rows label points M1/M2 while the point lines print them as\n(N) — two encodings of one taxonomy, both present in the parsed text.\n**Evidence:** \"M1 protons IGNORE electrons / M2 neutrons\" in guidance (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 30-44) against \"- **(1)** protons IGNORE\nelectrons / - **(1)** neutrons\" in points (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 43-57).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-02", "chunk_id": "MS-02:rec:MS-012", "content_sha256": "c94b5e4cfde66c04b3ff7ccc8be22a3608d2cce15a4cf8d2ac35a8a833e4e01c", "heading": "MS-012", "kind": "record", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-02", "artifact_version": 1.0, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-005", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "f61a5bafe6cacdf538e5e06d86f818e7737cbfe3", "syllabai_resources": "367b5d61cd5f1ab115f9947ba2981f08389540ee"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "MS-012", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": true, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "MS-012", "text": "### MS-012 — Point-level conditions on credit\n\n**Claim:** conditions attach at point level — no-working caps and\nconsequential-marking notes ride on the point lines.\n**Evidence:** the RAM scheme's \"35.4 with no working scores\" cap (SRC-QPMS-4CH1, 2019-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 84-98); the halogen-displacement scheme's\nincorrect-answer guard (\"incorrect M2\" in the same excerpt window, SRC-QPMS-4CH1,\n2019-06/4CH1-2C/questions.md lines 84-98).\nTemporal scope: CURRENT — AUTHORITATIVE."}
